{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22906","headline":"偶然二首 二 · 白居易","name":"偶然二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火发城头鱼水里，救火竭池鱼失水。\n乖龙藏在牛[领]中，雷击龙来牛枉死。\n人道蓍神龟骨灵，试卜鱼牛那至此。\n六十四卦七十钻，毕竟不能知所以。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22906.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22906","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}